	​\nThe role investors play in innovation and wealth creation\n​Whether thi
	s asset class aligns with their long-term goals\n​The simple methodology t
	hat creates a more intentional entry point into investing ​ \nYou’ll leave
	 this class with a clear picture of how capital flows\, how returns are ge
	nerated\, and whether this asset class belongs in your long-term strategy.
